    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369190/extras/275fff072ba50281cf00b812ed671a1a.poster.avif?t=1738807572\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369190/extras/275fff072ba50281cf00b812ed671a1a.webm?t=1738807572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369190/extras/275fff072ba50281cf00b812ed671a1a.mp4?t=1738807572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the world of Reptilian!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You're a young lizard named Isaac, who just recently arrived from the jungle at the famous Reptilian Resort Oasis!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living his whole life in the rainforests, Isaac has always dreamed of seeing his first sunset, and this oasis is rumored to have the best sunset in the world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the perfect spot to bask in the sunset, and maybe meet some friends along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore, meet new friends, and achieve your greatest dreams in the Reptilian Resort!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369190/extras/63b980d0774a1cde7e5d6fb5547c249a.poster.avif?t=1738807572\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369190/extras/63b980d0774a1cde7e5d6fb5547c249a.webm?t=1738807572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369190/extras/63b980d0774a1cde7e5d6fb5547c249a.mp4?t=1738807572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369190/extras/275fff072ba50281cf00b812ed671a1a.poster.avif?t=1738807572\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369190/extras/275fff072ba50281cf00b812ed671a1a.webm?t=1738807572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369190/extras/275fff072ba50281cf00b812ed671a1a.mp4?t=1738807572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the world of Reptilian!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You're a young lizard named Isaac, who just recently arrived from the jungle at the famous Reptilian Resort Oasis!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living his whole life in the rainforests, Isaac has always dreamed of seeing his first sunset, and this oasis is rumored to have the best sunset in the world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the perfect spot to bask in the sunset, and maybe meet some friends along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore, meet new friends, and achieve your greatest dreams in the Reptilian Resort!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369190/extras/63b980d0774a1cde7e5d6fb5547c249a.poster.avif?t=1738807572\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369190/extras/63b980d0774a1cde7e5d6fb5547c249a.webm?t=1738807572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369190/extras/63b980d0774a1cde7e5d6fb5547c249a.mp4?t=1738807572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
